REM SOURCE ONLY. First establish actual Caps+Num OUTPUT reports; replace YOUR_USB_SERIAL.
REM Reviewed compiled sender must be in Desktop/EvilDuckLedTest. Owner still types SEND.
GUI SPACE
DELAY 1000
STRING Terminal
ENTER
DELAY 1500
STRING ~/Desktop/EvilDuckLedTest/send-macos --caps-num-confirmed YOUR_USB_SERIAL
ENTER
